You are updating an existing rule-based extractor. Do NOT rewrite good rules; add or adjust only what is needed.

Task: German Legal Named Entity Recognition
Description: Recognize named entities in German legal text. Entities to look for: organisation, person. German capitalizes all nouns, so rules must use strong context anchors 

Input schema: {'text': 'str'}
Output schema:
entities: List[Entity]

Entity:
  text: string  # The matched text span
  start: integer  # Start character offset
  end: integer  # End character offset
  type: string  # Entity label

AVAILABLE ENTITY TYPES: ['organisation', 'person']
Rules MUST use one of these types in output_template.


DATA EVIDENCE FROM TRAINING:
- organisation (15 unique): "OGH", "Oberste Gerichtshof", "Sutterl\u00fcty Klagian Br\u00e4ndle Gisinger Lingenh\u00f6le Rechtsanw\u00e4lte GmbH", "Lerch Nagel Heinzle Rechtsanw\u00e4lte GmbH", "Landesgerichts Feldkirch", "Bezirksgerichts Bregenz", "Obersten Gerichtshof", "Metzler & Partner Rechtsanw\u00e4lte GmbH", "Landesgerichts Linz", "Bezirksgerichts Linz", "Landesgericht Linz", "Vogl Rechtsanwalt GmbH", "TalHeimaltriPlanung Systeme GmbH", "Oberlandesgerichts Innsbruck", "AlpenLogistik AG"
  In context: "Gericht [OGH]", "Kopf Der [Oberste Gerichtshof] hat als...", "...durch die [Sutterl\u00fcty Klagian Br\u00e4ndle Gisinger Lingenh\u00f6le Rechtsanw\u00e4lte GmbH] in Dornbirn, gegen...", "...durch die [Lerch Nagel Heinzle Rechtsanw\u00e4lte GmbH] in Lustenau, wegen...", "...den Beschluss des [Landesgerichts Feldkirch] als..."
- person (15 unique): "Mag. Ziegelbauer", "Dr. Hargassner", "Mag. Korn", "Dr. Stiefsohn", "Dr. Wallner-Friedl", "Paul Isakov", "Dipl.-Ing. Roxana Eibele", "Hon.-Prof. Dr. H\u00f6llwerth", "Hon.-Prof. Dr. Brenn", "Dr. Weixelbraun-Mohr", "Dr. Kodek", "Dr. Stefula", "Gerda Geibl", "MMag. Heinz Moosbacher", "Ing. Mag. Klaus Helm"
  In context: "...Senatspr\u00e4sidenten [Mag. Ziegelbauer] als Vorsitzenden...", "...und Hofr\u00e4te [Dr. Hargassner], Mag. Korn, Dr....", "...Dr. Hargassner, [Mag. Korn], Dr. Stiefsohn und...", "...Mag. Korn, [Dr. Stiefsohn] und Dr....", "...Dr. Stiefsohn und [Dr. Wallner-Friedl] als weitere..."

Note: Some entities contain multiple words; do NOT assume single-token matches.

Computed patterns match training strings only; generalize carefully.



PER-CLASS METRICS (current performance):
  organisation: P=89% R=50% F1=64% (TP=261 FP=32 FN=260)
  person: P=6% R=6% F1=6% (TP=29 FP=495 FN=488)

RULES with failures (full details, note any user_feedback on specific rules):
[
  {
    "name": "person_with_title",
    "description": "Extracts person names preceded by common German legal titles (Dr., Mag., PhD, Hon.-Prof., etc.)",
    "format": "regex",
    "content": "(?:Dr\\.?\\s+|Mag\\.?\\s+|PhD\\s+|Hon\\.-Prof\\.\\s+PD\\s+|MMag\\.\\s+)([A-Z][a-z]+(?:\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+)*)",
    "priority": 10,
    "output_template": {
      "text": "$1",
      "start": "$start",
      "end": "$end",
      "type": "person"
    },
    "output_key": "entities"
  },
  {
    "name": "person_in_party_context",
    "description": "Extracts person names appearing after 'Partei' (party) or 'vertreten durch' (represented by) without a title prefix",
    "format": "regex",
    "content": "(?:Partei\\s+|vertreten\\s+durch\\s+)([A-Z][a-z]+(?:\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+)*)",
    "priority": 8,
    "output_template": {
      "text": "$1",
      "start": "$start",
      "end": "$end",
      "type": "person"
    },
    "output_key": "entities"
  },
  {
    "name": "organisation_gericht_oghs",
    "description": "Extracts court names like OGH, Oberste Gerichtshof, Oberlandesgericht, Landesgericht",
    "format": "regex",
    "content": "(?:OGH|Oberste\\s+Gerichtshof|Oberlandesgerichts?\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+|Landesgerichts?\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+)",
    "priority": 9,
    "output_template": {
      "text": "$0",
      "start": "$start",
      "end": "$end",
      "type": "organisation"
    },
    "output_key": "entities"
  },
  {
    "name": "organisation_gmbh_gesellschaft",
    "description": "Extracts company names ending in GmbH or Gesellschaft mbH",
    "format": "regex",
    "content": "[A-Z][a-z]+(?:\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+)*\\s+(?:GmbH|Gesellschaft\\s+mbH)",
    "priority": 7,
    "output_template": {
      "text": "$0",
      "start": "$start",
      "end": "$end",
      "type": "organisation"
    },
    "output_key": "entities"
  }
]
